    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ef5a5aff",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a cartoon mermaid with her arms crossed, standing next to a genie lamp, with text that reads 'when he's muslim and asks you to role play.' This meme uses a harmful and stereotypical portrayal of Muslim men as being overly controlling or demanding in romantic or sexual contexts, implying that they expect women to engage in role-playing scenarios that may be demeaning or objectifying. The visual of the mermaid, often associated with fantasy and sexuality, combined with the text, reinforces a misogynistic and Islamophobic trope that portrays Muslim men as predatory or manipulative, and Muslim women as objects to be controlled or played with. This is a hateful meme that targets Muslim men and women by perpetuating harmful stereotypes about religious practice and gender roles, and it is intended to provoke negative attitudes toward Muslims and reinforce gender-based discrimination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_3bf3bdcb"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
