      "description": "A stylized cartoon mermaid with blonde hair in a ponytail, wearing a pink top and light blue tail with swirl patterns. She has her arms crossed in a defiant or annoyed posture, and is positioned next to a genie lamp. The mermaid is a central visual element and is used metaphorically in the meme to represent a woman being objectified or controlled in a role-playing scenario.",
