      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "role_play_concept",
      "label": "Role-Play as a Social or Sexual Interaction",
      "description": "Role-playing refers to the act of assuming a different identity or scenario, often for entertainment, social bonding, or sexual exploration. In this context, it is implied to be a request made by a Muslim man, which the meme portrays as inappropriate or demeaning, requiring the woman to participate in a fantasy-based scenario.",
